{
    "title": "Sticker Doll DIY Dressup Diary",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc85\ud83c\udffbSticker Doll is a beautiful DIY doll dress-up, fashion game based on the classic DIY paper arts and crafts. In this Sticker Doll DIY Dressup Diary game, you get to be the designer of your own doll. In sticker Doll, customize your dolls by choosing from the wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup looks. Dress up doll characters to interact with and enter unique stories and plots in this card doll game. This DIY doll makeover challenge allows you to craft your own custom flat dolls. So many cute outfits to choose from like dresses, shoes, hats & makeup in this doll dress up game.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc84GAME FOR GIRLS\r\nUnleash your inner stylist and embark on a fashion journey in Doll Dress Up Game!\r\nSticker Doll DIY Dressup Diary is a doll dress-up fashion game. Explore your creative side with this fashion girl game where you will dress up your sticker doll!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc57DRESS UP YOUR STICKER DOLL\r\nDoll dress-up game has wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup kits. Cut out card doll, choose the perfect dress for your doll with matching jewellery, chic shoes, classy hat, elegant makeup and transform your sticker doll into a fashion icon.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc60FASHION MAKEUP GAMES\r\nOur doll makeover games are perfect if you want explore your creativity as a makeup artist or fashion hair stylist. Craft your own doll, unlock fashion options and make sure your doll is always ready for any occasion.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6DOCUMENT DOLL\u2019S LIFE IN HER DIARY\r\nCapture your doll\u2019s every adventure and story in her diary like her first day at college, making friends at new college, going out with friends or on date and her wedding day.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc85\ud83c\udffbSticker Doll is a beautiful DIY doll dress-up, fashion game based on the classic DIY paper arts and crafts. In this Sticker Doll DIY Dressup Diary game, you get to be the designer of your own doll. In sticker Doll, customize your dolls by choosing from the wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup looks. Dress up doll characters to interact with and enter unique stories and plots in this card doll game. This DIY doll makeover challenge allows you to craft your own custom flat dolls. So many cute outfits to choose from like dresses, shoes, hats &amp; makeup in this doll dress up game.<br><br>\ud83d\udc84GAME FOR GIRLS<br>Unleash your inner stylist and embark on a fashion journey in Doll Dress Up Game!<br>Sticker Doll DIY Dressup Diary is a doll dress-up fashion game. Explore your creative side with this fashion girl game where you will dress up your sticker doll!<br><br>\ud83d\udc57DRESS UP YOUR STICKER DOLL<br>Doll dress-up game has wide variety of clothing options, accessories, hair styles, and makeup kits. Cut out card doll, choose the perfect dress for your doll with matching jewellery, chic shoes, classy hat, elegant makeup and transform your sticker doll into a fashion icon.<br><br>\ud83d\udc60FASHION MAKEUP GAMES<br>Our doll makeover games are perfect if you want explore your creativity as a makeup artist or fashion hair stylist. Craft your own doll, unlock fashion options and make sure your doll is always ready for any occasion.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd6DOCUMENT DOLL\u2019S LIFE IN HER DIARY<br>Capture your doll\u2019s every adventure and story in her diary like her first day at college, making friends at new college, going out with friends or on date and her wedding day.",
